   <crs:Description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Color slide film approximation. ISO 50. Landscapes. Lower Amount (40-60) for portraits; skin turns hot quickly. Visual approximation built from Lightroom sliders; not an exact reproduction.</rdf:li>
